cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Smriti in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Smriti: Fast and Slow Thinking for Private, Grounded Personal RAG"
abstract: >-
  Smriti is an open-source, local-first agentic RAG system for a student's notes, books and personal
  documents. A calibrated System-1 layer of fast, typed decisions routes questions, answers simple
  facts without an LLM and enforces guardrails, escalating to a System-2 LLM agent only when needed.
  The repository includes a reproducible experiment runner and evaluation data.
authors:
  - name: "Smriti contributors"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-08
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/MohitBareja16/smriti"
keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - agentic RAG
  - dual-process theory
  - LLM guardrails
  - calibration
  - privacy
